uments on his left chest, including an atom structure model badge, hanging gold chains, and a retro gold precision pocket watch and mechanical tube devices, with a gold button and short chain decoration on the right pocket, blending retro sci-fi and high academic scholar aesthetics, as shown in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> is Marcus, a battle-scarred, cold and determined strong muscular man wearing a dark blue and black future sci-fi heavy tactical armor, with a blue hexagonal glowing badge in the center of his chest armor, thick black metal shoulder and leg guards with silver metal strips, holding a tech-heavy black assault rifle with a red glowing magazine and gun body energy bar, standing steadily with legs apart on a pure white minimalist background, as shown in <Picture 3>.\n<Subject 4> is the Core Control Room, a futuristic high-tech control room interior constructed with a large amount of cold-toned dark metal panels and crisscrossing industrial pipelines, with a huge green glowing display screen embedded in the left wall showing a female portrait, a complex spherical network matrix, and dense data codes, a central console equipped with a transparent green holographic interactive keyboard in the middle, the ceiling and floor reflecting the cold green light, and a heavy metal sealed door in the right background topped with a striking red warning light strip, creating a strong contrast of cool and warm colors, as shown in <Picture 4>.\n<Subject 5> is the Maintenance Corridor, a future sci-fi industrial corridor with a dark and humid atmosphere, with thick dark metal pipes densely arranged on the left wall and transparent glass tubes inside which a wavy, violently glowing cyan energy medium flows, heavy metal cabins with dazzling cyan geometric neon lines on the right, a yellow triangular \"Restricted\" warning sign and a cyan glowing holographic digital HUD interface on the dark metal wall beside it, a wet floor reflecting the cyan and partially red lights, white 