ted by the massive twelve-clock-tower network map of the global energy grid. Twelve cold green nodes light up sequentially, casting the characters into dark silhouettes. Ella expands the network display, and one million consciousness nodes appear beneath each clock tower. Marcus looks up at the glowing map, and a weak green flash pulses through the vacuum tubes in UNIT-7's (<Subject 1>) chest. Ella speaks in a restrained, quiet voice: `<d>[Chinese] 每座钟塔收割100万人的意识，转化为计算力维持全球能源网络。`</d> The sequential ringing of the twelve nodes and a low, deep neural network hum fill the audio. As the shot ends, the underground connection map on the screen locks onto a hidden door, and UNIT-7's chest vacuum tubes return to their steady orange glow. Marcus has relaxed his arrest posture, standing shoulder to shoulder with Ella, while the rear security door remains open, leading toward the Maintenance Corridor (<Subject 5>).\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe overall soundscape is dominated by the cold, humming room tone of the high-tech Core Control Room (<Subject 4>), layered with the digital sounds of database switching, the sharp scraping of mechanical fingertips on glass, the sequential resonant ringing of twelve energy nodes, and a low, deep neural network hum that underscores the tense revelation.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1490, 6520], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 18}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "colo